  "agent": {
    "note": "First Alpine/hero stat-card (@m0saic/alpine/stat-card/v1), based on charts/stat-card re-styled to the pulse hero look: rounded #161b22 card, GREEN accent chip + caps label, dominant count-up value, SVG-triangle delta (green up / red down) + muted sublabel. Self-contained (no hero-pack dependency; hero palette mirrored locally). Rendered at the real desktop grid-cell size (386x277). The green chip is a PLACEHOLDER for a per-KPI icon — NO icon assets exist in the repo yet (only mosaic.svg).",
